# 2026-09-15: repo hygiene —
# `key` holds a live API key and must NEVER enter git history.
# Release tarballs are `make package` outputs (§7.55 switched naming to
# *.tar.gz, which the old `*.tgz` rule did not cover); same for checksums.
key
*.tar.gz
*.tar.gz.sha256
# §7.77: `make package` 产物目录 —— tarball + sha256 落 dist/ 而非顶层。
dist/

